&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and grow the team through hiring, coaching, and career development, and hold a high bar for engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, and other engineering teams to set roadmap priorities and deliver against product goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term product delivery with long-term investment in technical quality and platform scalability, so the platform holds up at millions of tenants and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run operational excellence through engineering processes, incident management, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and contribute code to stay close to the technology and unblock the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
